           later: "When you want those posts to outlive the feed, The Weekend Ecosystem™ turns them into a site that ranks." },
      V: { name: "Pretty & Paid PLR Vault™", price: "$11 per month · its own subscription",
           why: "Your shop isn't failing because you can't sell. It's failing because the shelf is empty. Stock it with finished products you rebrand in Canva and list the same week.",
           moves: ["Pick the three products that fit your niche — not ten", "Rebrand them in Canva: your colours, your fonts, your name", "Let PLR Glow Studio write the titles, descriptions and tags, then list all three"],
           cta: "Open Pretty & Paid PLR Vault™", href: "/shop/pretty-and-paid-plr-vault", aff: false,
           later: "When the shop deserves a home that Google can find, The Weekend Ecosystem™ builds it." },
      W: { name: "The Weekend Ecosystem™", price: "$97 one-time, or 3 payments of $33.33 · every future update included",
