        ["None of these yet", "Nothing yet", {S:3,W:-3}, "none"] ] },
      { sec: "Where it stops", q: "Where exactly does it stop moving?", k: "stuck", o: [
        ["I don't know what to do first, so I do a little of everything", "Not knowing the order to build in", {S:3}],
        ["I run out of things to post, then go quiet", "Running out of things to post", {P:3}],
        ["Making products from a blank page takes weeks", "Making products from a blank page", {V:3}],
        ["My listings exist, but they don't move", "Listings that sit there", {V:2,S:1}],
